h\">Meet several Characters who will help you on your path to restore the Adventurer Guild. Each one with their own personal stories and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026000/extras/ca40b3471ca54a89318e52babb867685.poster.avif?t=1750463311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026000/extras/ca40b3471ca54a89318e52babb867685.webm?t=1750463311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026000/extras/ca40b3471ca54a89318e52babb867685.mp4?t=1750463311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
